  "label": "The man is mapped as the person who goes on a date and gets stood up",
  "description": "The visual material of the man, with his resigned and disappointed expression, is mapped onto the textual narrative 'goes on a date' and 'gets stood up'. The man's emotional state and body language are used to represent the experience of dating rejection described in the text. This is an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the man) embodies the textual concept (the person experiencing dating rejection).",
